Subject: [PATCH 236/260] [ae-patch] Restart Claude in the same chat to switch
 into or out of bypass permissions

Picking Bypass permissions on a running claude-native session restarts the Claude pane in the same conversation with --permission-mode bypassPermissions, and leaving bypass restarts it again with the target mode, so no pane keeps a bypass launch around. No session is launched with --allow-dangerously-skip-permissions. The restart is refused while a reply or an approval is in progress.
